{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1767383,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Founder's Trail","festival_id":null,"organization_id":607,"web_url":"ecell.iitp.ac.in\/","start_date":"2026-10-08T23:59:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-28T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/founders-trail-indian-institute-of-technology-iit-patna-1767383","region":"online","details":"<p><strong>Founder&rsquo;s Trail<\/strong> is an entrepreneurship challenge by <strong>E-Cell, IIT Patna<\/strong>, where participants take a startup idea from identifying a problem to actually taking it to the market.<\/p>\n<p>The challenge is divided into <strong>3 rounds : <\/strong><strong>Idea &amp; Research, Solution &amp; GTM, and Marketing &amp; Execution<\/strong>, with each round building on the previous one.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Team Size:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Participation requires teams of <strong>2-3 people<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 1: Discover<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Start with a <strong>real problem<\/strong> and develop a startup idea around it. Your task is to show that the problem actually exists, understand your target customers, and support your idea with proper market research.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Suggested deliverables:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Problem Statement<\/strong> - What problem are you solving and for whom?<\/li>\n<li><strong>Startup Idea<\/strong> - Your proposed solution and how it solves the problem.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Startup Domain<\/strong> - Identify the industry\/domain in which your startup operates .<\/li>\n<li><strong>Target Customers<\/strong> - Define your primary customer segment and their key needs or pain points.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Market Research<\/strong> - Primary\/secondary research, customer insights and relevant data.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Competitor Analysis<\/strong> - Existing competitors, alternatives and your differentiation.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Startup Identity<\/strong> - Startup name, logo and a basic brand identity representing your idea.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Idea Submission<\/strong> - A concise document\/presentation combining the above.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Max no of slides(excluding cover page ) : 4<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 2: Design<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Now turn your idea into a <strong>practical and viable venture<\/strong> and plan how you will take it to your first customers. Participants will define the solution, business model, pricing and a clear GTM (Go-To-Market) strategy.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Suggested deliverables:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Solution Design<\/strong> - Product\/service concept, prototype or working model.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Customer Journey<\/strong> - How the customer discovers, uses and receives value from your solution.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Business Model<\/strong> - Pricing, basic costs and how the venture will generate revenue.<\/li>\n<li><strong>GTM Strategy<\/strong> - Target customers, acquisition channels and conversion strategy.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Submission<\/strong> - Present the complete venture and its execution plan with the above requirements.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Max no of slides (excluding cover page) : 4<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 3: Deliver<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The final stage challenges teams to take their venture beyond planning and test it in the real world. Teams will execute their marketing strategy, reach potential customers, and collect real-world feedback to evaluate and improve their venture<\/p>\n<p><strong>Marketing &amp; Execution Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Content &amp; Social Media Creation:<\/strong> Create and publish promotional Reels and short-form content on your project's dedicated Instagram account. Ensure you use the official event hashtag and tag <strong>@ecell_iitpatna<\/strong> in all posts.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Customer Acquisition:<\/strong> Reach customers beyond social media using other outreach methods, campus groups and product demos.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Tracking &amp; Metrics:<\/strong> Measure success by monitoring views, engagement, inquiries, qualified leads.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Iteration &amp; Improvement:<\/strong> How you will use performance data and customer feedback to refine your messaging and continuously improve your venture.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Submission:<\/strong> Explain what you did in this round properly and also attach all the social media pages used for PR.<br \/>Max no of slides (excluding cover page) : 3<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":"12k price pool and certificates for winners.","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":1269645,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-07T18:14:08+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-07T22:33:00+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"innovation_challenge","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"rghHDVf","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":0,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-07 18:55:06","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/6ac67a31ac1b2_pat_logo.jpg","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/6ac67a31ac1b2_pat_logo.jpg","regnRequirements":{"id":2499069,"opportunity_id":1767383,"festival_id":null,"max_team_size":3,"min_team_size":2,